) -> BaseWriter:
    """Factory function to create the appropriate writer."""
    writers: Dict[str, Type[BaseWriter]] = {
        "json": JsonWriter,
        "csv": CsvWriter,
        "null": NullWriter,
    }
    cls = writers.get(format)
